# CIPHER // 2077 direct-install compatibility overlay

This is for the Revenge screen that only shows **Install a plugin**.

Upload these files/folders into the ROOT of your existing `Shmeckle/CIPHER77`
repository, preserving the `builds/com.cipher2077.ui/` folder structure.

It is okay to keep the existing:
- `.github/`
- `plugins/`
- `repo.config.json`
- `cipher-2077.json`
- `rajdhani.json`

After upload the repo should additionally contain:

manifest.json
repo.json
builds/
  com.cipher2077.ui/
    manifest.json
    index.js

Then, in Discord -> Settings -> Revenge -> Plugins -> Install a plugin,
paste ONLY this base URL:

https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Shmeckle/CIPHER77/main/

Do not append `manifest.json`, `repo.json`, or `index.js`. The installer adds
`manifest.json` itself.

The root manifest points the installer at:
builds/com.cipher2077.ui/index.js

Version: 0.1.1
